title: "GH-686: validate extension flag descriptors and support repeatable as a list alias"
description: "Reject unknown extension flag descriptor keys at registration and support repeatable:true as a documented alias for list:true so package author intent cannot silently degrade to Commander last-wins behavior. Preserve exact mixed long/short occurrence order from the shipped GH-496 implementation."
