comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-25T00:15:34.593Z",codex-root,"Duplicate check: GH-496/pm-kfq5 is terminal and correctly shipped list:true accumulation. GH-686 reproduces a distinct residual contract: TypeScript excess-property checking can be bypassed at runtime, unknown descriptor keys are accepted silently, and repeatable is not a supported alias. This item preserves pm-kfq5 as shipped lineage and owns only descriptor validation plus alias parity."
  "2026-07-25T02:02:12.725Z","harness:codex","Evidence: portable repository provenance is now represented as source_workspace_root, repo_root, and pm_root_rel and consumed by SDK governance validation without leaking the source checkout into tracker state. Packed install and package-first dogfood acceptance pass."
  "2026-07-25T02:02:50.680Z","harness:codex","Correction to the immediately preceding evidence comment: this item owns extension flag descriptor validation. Evidence: unknown keys reject, repeatable aliases list semantics, structured commas are preserved, and defaults follow the same validation path; contract snapshots and full coverage pass."
